msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Disallow WP File Edit"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:909
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Prevent the modification of your website's core files through the WordPress admin panel."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:912
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Custom COOKIEHASH"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:913
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Generate and inject a random COOKIEHASH constant into wp-config.php when the module is activated."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:916
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Disable XML-RPC"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:917
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Enhance your website's security by fortifying it against brute force, (DoS) and (DDoS) attacks through "
"advanced XML-RPC protection. In addition, our solution proactively disables trackbacks and pingbacks, "
"bolstering your site's defense mechanisms."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:920
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Disallow register user"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:921
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Prevent the creation of new user accounts on your website with the native WordPress registration form."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:924
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Lock Site URL"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:925
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Prevent the modification of the site URL on your website."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:928
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Lock Admin Email"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:929
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Prevent the modification of the admin email address on your website."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:932
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Blacklisted Usernames"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:933
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Prevent the creation of new user accounts with predifined blacklisted usernames. Blacklist usernames that are "
"too common."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:936
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Force Strong Password"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:937
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Enforce the use of strong passwords for all users on your website. This feature is especially useful for "
"websites with multiple users, as it ensures that all users have a strong password that is difficult to guess "
"or crack."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:940
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Move Login URL"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:941
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Change the default login URL to a custom URL of your choice."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:944
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Two Factor Authentication"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:945
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Add an extra layer of security to your website by enabling two-factor authentication for all users."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:948
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Hide Login Errors"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:949
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Hide the default WordPress login errors that appear when an incorrect username or password is entered."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:952
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Disallow Theme Upload"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:953
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Disable zip file uploads for themes, which are used to install themes on your website."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:956
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Disallow Plugin Upload"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:957
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Disable zip file uploads for plugins, which are used to install plugins on your website."
msgstr ""

