#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1065
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Tidy up user profiles by removing sections you do not utilise."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1068
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Quick Add Post"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1069
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "A new button to quickly add new posts to speed up your workflow."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1072
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Export Posts & Pages"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1073
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Download your posts and pages to a .csv format."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1076
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Duplicate Menu"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1077
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Easily duplicate your WordPress Menus"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1080
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Child theme generator"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1081
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "A simple tool to generate a child theme on your WordPress. You can disable it after generation."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1084
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Redirect 404 to Homepage"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1085
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Sends visitors to your homepage if they try to access a page that doesn't exist, ensuring they stay on your "
"site."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1088
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Maintenance Mode"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1089
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Show a customizable maintenance page on the frontend while performing a brief maintenance to your site. "
"Logged-in administrators can still view the site as usual."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1092
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Password Protection"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1093
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Password-protect the entire site to hide the content from public view and search engine bots / crawlers. "
"Logged-in administrators can still access the site as usual."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1096
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Content Duplication"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1097
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Enable one-click duplication of pages, posts and custom posts. The corresponding taxonomy terms and post meta "
"will also be duplicated."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1100
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Post Per Page"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1101
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid "Specifying the number of posts to display per page, for each post type."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1104
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "Content Order"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1105
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Enable custom ordering of various \"hierarchical\" content types or those supporting \"page attributes\". A "
"new 'Order' sub-menu will appear for enabled content type(s)."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1108
msgctxt "Module name"
msgid "External Permalinks"
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1109
msgctxt "Module description"
msgid ""
"Enable pages, posts and/or custom post types to have permalinks that point to external URLs. The "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" attribute will also be added for enhanced security and SEO benefits."
msgstr ""

#: admin/class-modules-data.php:1112
msgctxt "Module name"
